    "language_probability": 1,
    "text": "So the system they build puts the dollar at the center of everything. The dollar is fixed to gold at thirty five dollars an ounce. The British pound, the French franc, the German mark, and the Japanese yen are all fixed to the dollar. And if a foreign central bank holds dollars, it can hand them back to America and get gold in return. The dollar becomes as good as gold. For about twenty years it works.",
